// --- RFI-IRFOS STATE 0 ESCROW LEDGER ---
// Module: architecture/ledger/trit_consensus_v1.tern
// Purpose: Picosecond-level transaction settlement without blockchain overhead.
// Logic: Triadic Majority Handshake (State 0 Escrow).
